ks still run - strip them) | carried |\n57\t| 18 | Ruby `.rb` (+ Rack host) | seen D16 | `# HUNTRESS_ANALYSIS_V1:<TAG>-..` + `DESCRIPTOR_<8HEX> = \"..\"` (uppercase const), `require`, `def ..end`, `def build_plan_<id>` returning `{ descriptor: DESCRIPTOR_<ID> }`, host `ruby_rack` = `INERT_RACK_<ID> = ->(_env) { [200, {..}, [..]] }` lambda | V3_MARK (carried solver, unchanged); `ruby -c f.rb` syntax only; ERB/Rails `<%= %>` hosts still unseen | carried |\n58\t| 67 | AutoHotkey `.ahk` (v2) | seen D17 | `#Requires AutoHotkey v2.0`, `; HUNTRESS_ANALYSIS_V1:..`, `descriptor_<8hex> := \"..\"`, `buildPlan_<id>() { global ..; return Map(\"descriptor\", ..) }`; v1 legacy would be `x = text` unquoted + `%x%` derefs + `( .. )` continuation sections | V3_MARK (carried solver, unchanged); compiled Ahk2Exe PE = RT_RCDATA `>AUTOHOTKEY SCRIPT<` -> lib.codec carrier walk (built D17 night, also AHK v1 `x = text` / continuation sections) | carried; compiled exe / v1 syntax = low/med |\n59\t| 19 | PowerShell module / `.psm1` `.psd1` `.ps1xml` (v=3 polyglot-powershell) | gap (PS only v=1) | `Export-ModuleMember`, `FunctionsToExport`, `<Types><Type><ScriptMethod><Script>`, `<#  #>` block comments (marker may sit inside `<# #>`) | `.venv/bin/ps1 < f.psm1`; lxml for ps1xml `<Script>` nodes | **high**: PS is the canonical malware language and has no v=3 fixture |\n60\t| 20 | Tcl / Expect | gap | `#!/usr/bin/tclsh`, `set descriptor_x \"...\"` (no `=`!), `proc`, `puts`, `binary decode base64`, `{braces}` strings | `tclsh` MISSING (`apt install tcl`); static: regex `set\\s+descriptor_\\w+\\s+[\"{]` | med |\n61\t| 21 | R script | gap | `<-` assignment, `library(`, `base64enc::`, `rawToChar(`, `system(`, `#` comments | `Rscript` MISSING (`apt install r-base-core`, big); static `<-` descriptor regex | low/med |\n62\t| 22 | Groovy / Jenkinsfile | gap | `pipeline { agent .. stages`, `sh '''..'''`, `def x = \"..\"`, `\"cmd\".execute()`, `.decodeBase64()` | `groovy` MISSING (java INSTALLED; jar from 